Jon '''"jOn"''' Rinneby is a Swedish Quakeworld player who started his career in [[1999]] after moving from the city of Lund to small town Tranås (nothing to do there except eating hot dogs and playing QW). With staggering steps and high ping his career began under the name ''RpBot'', later changed to jOn sometimes in early [[2000]]. He is mostly known for his 1on1 skills, but has played in quite many clans over the years, among them [[Clan Cute]], [[Orkney Clan]], [[Euthanasia]] and [[Leftovers]] (who he founded). jOn stopped playing in 2008-2009, played a few games in 2015 and 2021 and decided to return in 2024.

